LEFT JOIN (SELECT Cast(''+FTPStageTableNamePK+'' As Varchar(200))  AS [BusinessPartner], Cast(''+FTPStagColumnName+ '' As Varchar(200)) AS ConfigValue From ''+FTPStageTableName+'' ) FTP  
